<title>INDONESIA: Andayani H1 net dives to 21.44 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Andayani H1 net dives to 21.44 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   21.44 vs 33.59</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)    67 vs 105</p>
<p>    Net sales			    99.69 vs 110.45</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   23.13 vs 31.44</p>
<p>Note: PT Andayani Megah, a member of the Gadjah Tunggal Group, is a tyre cord firm.</p>
</text>
